# Native report namespace

- `opencode_report.py:_extract_opencode_report_from_db()` still defaults its DB
  reads to the ambient namespace. This is the report fallback, not the exact
  transcript resolver. The native-history/read-path lane must carry the recorded
  database path into report extraction or delete that fallback; never resolve a
  tracked report from an ambient database by native ID alone. Found during the
  native-harness-session-identity Lane C fix pass; code-path inspection, not a
  reproduced live-server failure.

# Pi launch refusal typing

- `pi.py:PiAdapter.finalize_native_identity()` still raises a string `ValueError`
  for a tracked source with no recorded store. Change that no-store refusal to
  `NativeSessionUnavailable(ref, "unbound")` in the Pi-owned lane. Lane C fix2
  was explicitly limited to the source-field rename in this file; exact Pi file
  missing/ambiguous refusals in `pi_identity.py` are already typed.
